<title>USA: DePuy Inc says IPO registration effective.</title>
<headline>DePuy Inc says IPO registration effective.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW, Ind. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DePuy Inc said Wednesday its registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an initial public offering of 14,780,000 shares of common stock has become effective.</p>
<p>The common stock is being offered by both DePuy and Corange Ltd, parent company of Boehringer Mannheim Group, a European-based pharmaceutical, chemical and diagnostic firm.</p>
<p>DePuy expects to begin trading Thursday on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;DPU.&quot; The company designs and manufactures orthopedic devices and supplies.</p>
<p>Earlier Wednesday, it reported net earnings for the third quarter of $24.0 million on revenues of $167.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
